# lyrics-combined

Runs both lyrics sources and produces a single `lyrics-final.json` with
the best available lyrics for each track.

## Sources

| Source | Producer | Output |
|---|---|---|
| lyrics.nu | `scripts/lyrics-scrapping/` | `lyrics-scrapping/lyrics-bodies.json` |
| matb3aa | `scripts/matb3aa-lyrics/` | `matb3aa-lyrics/lyrics-bodies.json` |

## Winner rules

1. **matb3aa placeholders discarded** — any matb3aa entry with `charCount < 100` is dropped.
2. **lyrics.nu kept whole** — no length filter on lyrics.nu entries.
3. **Only one source has lyrics** → that source wins.
4. **Both have lyrics** → **longest wins**. On tie, matb3aa wins.
5. **Neither has lyrics** → track recorded as `no-lyrics`.

## Run

From `E:\matb3aa-game\server`:

node scripts/lyrics-combined/index.js

text

One artist only:
node scripts/lyrics-combined/index.js --artist=65

text

Skip stages (useful if you've already fetched one source):
node scripts/lyrics-combined/index.js --skip-matb3aa
node scripts/lyrics-combined/index.js --skip-lyricsnu



## Flags

| Flag | Effect |
|---|---|
| `--artist=N` | Filter to one artist across all stages |
| `--fresh` | Re-fetch everything (ignore cached JSON) |
| `--skip-matb3aa` | Skip the matb3aa stage (use existing `matb3aa-lyrics/lyrics-bodies.json`) |
| `--skip-lyricsnu` | Skip the lyrics.nu stage (use existing `lyrics-scrapping/lyrics-bodies.json`) |

## Output

`lyrics-final.json`:

```json
{
  "generatedAt": "...",
  "summary": {
    "tracksTotal": 10307,
    "fromLyricsNuOnly": ...,
    "fromMatb3aaOnly": ...,
    "fromBothLongest": ...,
    "fromBothTieMatb3aa": ...,
    "discardedMatb3aaPlaceholder": ...,
    "noLyrics": ...,
    "coverage": 88.1
  },
  "tracks": [
    {
      "artistId": 65,
      "artistName": "تامر حسني",
      "trackName": "اغنية بغير عليها",
      "lyrics": "...",
      "source": "lyrics-nu",
      "sourceDetail": "matb3aa-placeholder-lyrics-nu-wins",
      "bytes": 945,
      "charCount": 535,
      "lineCount": 22,
      "matb3aaId": 2353,
      "songUrl": "https://lyrics.nu/kalimat-aghani/.../",
      "isSynced": false
    }
  ]
}